      "message": "\u003e \u003e I\u0027ll wait for things to be clear before merging.\n\u003e \n\u003e Using using CMake 3.18.4 `target_link_libraries(main WebP::webp)` seems to set `-isystem ${BUILD_DIR}/webp-install/usr/local/include` and `-isystem ${BUILD_DIR}/webp-install/usr/local/include/webp`. There\u0027s actually a typo in the here-doc for `target_include_directories()`, `${WEBP_INCLUDE_DIRS}` will get expanded early, it should be escaped.\n\nI added:\n\n```\nif(NOT WEBP_LIBRARIES OR NOT WebP_LIBRARIES)\n  message(FATAL_ERROR \"(WebP|WEBP)_LIBRARIES should be non-empty\")\nendif()\n\n```\n\nand if the branch has this change:\n\n```\nif(NOT WEBP_INCLUDE_DIRS OR NOT WebP_INCLUDE_DIRS)\n  message(FATAL_ERROR \"(WebP|WEBP)_INCLUDE_DIRS should be non-empty\")\nendif()\n```",
      "parentUuid": "aea101f3_1546d998",
      "revId": "57c58105f3244d9ce21eab2d9bc72e1cd799b6cb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
